   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>The class TimeBase is a pseudo-clock. The class TimeBase is a pseudo-clock that is used as the first template argument to std::chrono::time_point to indicate that the time point represents local time with respect of a not-yet-specified timeBaseResource.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
