     "html": "<ul class=\"mlist\"><li><a href=\"#SWS_TS_01263\"><code>duration</code></a> <span class=\"dim\">required type declaration to fulfill the C++ Clock requirements used to measure the time since epoch</span></li><li><a href=\"#SWS_TS_01262\"><code>period</code></a> <span class=\"dim\">required type declaration to fulfill the C++ Clock requirements representing the tick period of the duration</span></li><li><a href=\"#SWS_TS_01261\"><code>rep</code></a> <span class=\"dim\">required type declaration to fulfill the C++ Clock requirements representing the number of ticks</span></li><li><a href=\"#SWS_TS_01264\"><code>time_point</code></a> <span class=\"dim\">represents a point in time</span></li></ul>",
